    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bracket matching</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-remove-to-make-valid-parentheses/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1249</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Minimum Remove to Make Valid Parentheses</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every bracket that cannot be matched must go, and nothing else: a ')' that arrives when nothing is open, and every '(' still open at the end. A stack of open indices finds both in one pass. O(n) time, O(n) space (or two counter passes with no stack).</p>\n"
